    {
      "id": "l05-comparativos",
      "title": "Comparativos y superlativos",
      "summary": "Más que, menos que, tan… como, el más; formas cortas, largas e irregulares.",
      "minutes": 16,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Tipo de adjetivo",
            "Comparativo",
            "Superlativo",
            "Ejemplos"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Corto (1 sílaba)",
              "+ er + than",
              "the + est",
              "tall → taller than → the tallest"
            ],
            [
              "Corto en consonante – vocal – consonante",
              "duplica + er",
              "duplica + est",
              "big → bigger → the biggest"
            ],
            [
              "Termina en y",
              "ier",
              "the iest",
              "heavy → heavier → the heaviest"
            ],
            [
              "Largo (2 o más sílabas)",
              "more + adjetivo + than",
              "the most + adjetivo",
              "expensive → more expensive → the most expensive"
            ],
            [
              "Irregulares",
              "good → better; bad → worse; far → farther / further",
              "the best; the worst; the farthest / furthest",
              ""
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Estructura",
            "Ejemplo",
            "Español"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "as + adjetivo + as",
              "Steel is not as cheap as concrete.",
              "El acero no es tan barato como el hormigón."
            ],
            [
              "less + adjetivo + than",
              "This method is less accurate than that one.",
              "Este método es menos preciso que ese."
            ],
            [
              "the same as",
              "Beam A is the same as beam B.",
              "La viga A es igual a la B."
            ],
            [
              "different from",
              "Clay is different from sand.",
              "La arcilla es diferente de la arena."
            ],
            [
              "twice as … as",
              "It is twice as long as the other.",
              "Es el doble de largo que el otro."
            ],
            [
              "the + comparativo, the + comparativo",
              "The higher the load, the greater the deflection.",
              "Cuanto mayor la carga, mayor la deflexión."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "kind": "importante",
          "text": "Nunca se combinan las dos formas: «more bigger» o «the most tallest» son incorrectas. Es «bigger» o «more expensive», no las dos cosas.",
          "title": "No dupliques"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "kind": "ingenieria",
          "text": "Los comparativos son constantes en textos técnicos: «a **stiffer** beam», «a **lower** cost», «**higher** strength», «the **most critical** section», «the **worst**-case scenario»."
        },
        {
          "type": "quiz",
          "question": "Comparativo de «big»:",
          "options": [
            "more big",
            "bigger",
            "biger",
            "biggest"
          ],
          "correct": 1,
          "explanation": "Duplica la g."
        },
        {
          "type": "quiz",
          "question": "Comparativo de «expensive»:",
          "options": [
            "expensiver",
            "more expensive",
            "most expensive",
            "expensivest"
          ],
          "correct": 1,
          "explanation": "Adjetivo largo."
        },
        {
          "type": "quiz",
          "question": "Superlativo de «good»:",
          "options": [
            "the goodest",
